{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the world ends, who will you spend your final hours with?\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>bygone snow</i> is a\u00a0visual novel for the GBA. The game was made in exactly two weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story (around 30 minutes)\u00a0about two people and their relationship as their time comes to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Kishan02 and Mireille Scieppan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a ROM made for the GBA, and can thus be played on anything that plays GBA games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows emulated version that is set to try and visually mimic the looks of a GBA, and with controls set to mirror\u00a0your typical PC visual novels.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is part of the Garenburg series, but it is a standalone title that requires no previous information to play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065050?t=1766740309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065050/84b306b692edc59286da401bbea1260ec82a5b02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766740309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065050/cc7bcb179df22d58862847900d1fab9339c0c911/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766740309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item